WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.276 --> 00:00:05.697
Chuck: Whoa!

2
00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:17.840
I've got such a headache.

3
00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:21.881
Chuck: I don't see Danny and Brad anywhere.

4
00:00:21.901 --> 00:00:23.402
Dave: Ha!

5
00:00:23.802 --> 00:00:26.823
I guess they were too scared to stick around.

6
00:00:28.283 --> 00:00:33.137
Chuck: Wait a minute where are we?

7
00:00:33.157 --> 00:00:36.699
Dave: Yeah, this looks different.

8
00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:40.562
Chuck: I remember there was a flash of lightning.

9
00:00:40.582 --> 00:00:42.563
Dave: That's right.

10
00:00:43.564 --> 00:00:46.006
And Danny was pointing that toy gun at us.

11
00:00:46.026 --> 00:00:50.029
Chuck: Do you think the gun actually did something?

12
00:00:50.049 --> 00:00:51.750
Dave: Of course not.

13
00:00:52.450 --> 00:00:54.171
It was just a stupid toy.

14
00:00:54.191 --> 00:00:58.354
Chuck: But this grass is really, really tall.

15
00:00:58.374 --> 00:01:04.425
Dave: Maybe maybe the lightning made the grass grow super tall.

16
00:01:04.445 --> 00:01:09.871
Chuck: I don't know, maybe.

17
00:01:09.891 --> 00:01:14.997
Dave: Where did that come from?

18
00:01:18.862 --> 00:01:20.364
Hey! What's going on?

19
00:01:34.892 --> 00:01:35.232
Dave: Take cover!

20
00:01:35.252 --> 00:01:37.313
Dave: I think the falling water has stopped.

21
00:01:38.053 --> 00:01:41.515
Chuck: Something very, very weird is going on.

22
00:01:45.736 --> 00:01:47.337
Maybe it's just a dream.

23
00:01:47.357 --> 00:01:52.519
Chuck: That must be the explanation, except for one thing.

24
00:01:52.539 --> 00:01:54.120
Dave: What's that?

25
00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:57.781
Chuck: How can we both be having the same dream?

26
00:01:57.801 --> 00:02:03.544
Dave: I don't know how, but it must be a dream.

27
00:02:05.508 --> 00:02:09.210
Dave: What a great dream!

28
00:02:14.233 --> 00:02:15.494
This is so funny.

29
00:02:15.514 --> 00:02:18.976
Dave: We must have fallen asleep in class!

30
00:02:19.876 --> 00:02:21.357
Chuck: That must be it!

31
00:02:22.398 --> 00:02:23.978
We're dreaming at our desks.

32
00:02:23.998 --> 00:02:28.561
Dave: The other kids are studying, but we're dreaming about an adventure.

33
00:02:29.481 --> 00:02:30.382
Dave: This is great!

34
00:02:36.972 --> 00:02:44.237
Chuck: But if we're dreaming Dave: Yes Chuck: Then it wouldn't hurt if I pinched you, would it?

35
00:02:44.257 --> 00:02:46.558
Dave: No, it wouldn't.

36
00:02:47.679 --> 00:02:48.520
Chuck: Let's try it.

37
00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:51.222
Dave: Ow!

38
00:02:51.282 --> 00:02:52.062
That hurts!

39
00:02:52.242 --> 00:02:54.444
Chuck: Hey!

40
00:02:54.904 --> 00:02:56.165
What did you do that for?

41
00:02:56.185 --> 00:02:58.166
Dave: You started it!

42
00:03:03.069 --> 00:03:03.910
Wait a second!

43
00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:04.730
Dave: What?

44
00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:06.752
Chuck: Do you know what this means?

45
00:03:08.012 --> 00:03:08.532
Dave: Yeah.

46
00:03:08.793 --> 00:03:10.233
It means I'm going to get you!

47
00:03:10.253 --> 00:03:11.814
Chuck: No!

48
00:03:12.435 --> 00:03:14.256
It means we're not dreaming!

49
00:03:14.276 --> 00:03:22.080
Dave: So if we're not dreaming Chuck: Then everything around us is real.

50
00:03:22.100 --> 00:03:27.103
Dave: We are in a strange new land with super tall grass.

51
00:03:27.123 --> 00:03:32.246
Chuck: Yes, everything looks strange.

52
00:03:33.186 --> 00:03:36.008
But for some reason, it feels familiar.

53
00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:38.682
Dave: What was that?

54
00:03:38.702 --> 00:03:41.990
Chuck: I wonder if we are in danger.
